- [x] **Phase 5: GPU Acceleration (D3D11)**
  - [x] **Research & Init**
    - [x] [VideoThumbnailer](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/VideoThumbnailer.h#15-16): Init D3D11 `AVHWDeviceContext`
    - [x] Implement `get_format` callback for D3D11VA
  - [x] **Implementation**
    - [x] Pipeline: Decode -> D3D11 Surface -> Transfer -> SwScale -> QImage
    - [x] Fallback to Software Decoding on failure
  - [x] **Verification**
    - [x] Verify lower CPU usage
    - [x] Verify log output confirmation


- [x] **Phase 6: Bug Fix (D3D11 Instability)**
  - [x] Thread-safe [initHardware](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/VideoThumbnailer.cpp#78-107) (Mutex)
  - [x] Limit concurrent Hardware Decoding (Semaphore)
  - [x] Implement Automatic Software Fallback in [VideoThumbnailer](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/VideoThumbnailer.h#15-16)
  - [x] Robust error handling for `get_buffer` failure (Implicit via semaphore)

- [x] **Phase 7: Feature Polish**
  - [x] **Smart Video Thumbnails**
    - [x] Implement "Black Frame" detection (Luma < 25)
    - [x] Implement Retry Logic (10% and 25% seek)
    - [x] Verify no regression in D3D11 stability

- [x] **Phase 8: Release v2.0 (Reforged)**
  - [x] **Cleanup**: Remove legacy folders and test apps
  - [x] **Documentation**: Engineering Philosophy & Roadmap
  - [x] **Verification**: Clean Build v2.0.0
  - [x] **CRIT FIX**: Memory Leak & D3D11 Circuit Breaker implementation

- [x] **Phase 9: Performance Enhancements**
  - [x] **RAW Optimization**: Switch to Embedded Preview extraction (100x speedup)
  - [x] **Smart Loading**: Toggle for Fast Preview vs Full Decode implemented via Settings

