    - [x] [AsyncImageProvider](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/AsyncImageProvider.h#34-58): Viewer requests -> Immediate, Thumbnails -> Low
  - [x] **Task Cancellation**
    - [x] `TaskScheduler::clear()` on folder change (`ImageModel::scanDirectory`)
  - [x] **Advanced Hardening**
    - [x] Video/Raw Dimension Limits (>8K/12K)
    - [x] RAII for FFmpeg ([VideoThumbnailer](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/VideoThumbnailer.h#15-16))
  - [x] **UI Polish**
    - [x] Fix Settings Menu Scroll/Layout
    - [x] Implement "Current API" feedback in UI

- [x] **Phase 5: GPU Acceleration (D3D11)**
  - [x] **Research & Init**
    - [x] [VideoThumbnailer](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/VideoThumbnailer.h#15-16): Init D3D11 `AVHWDeviceContext`
    - [x] Implement `get_format` callback for D3D11VA
  - [x] **Implementation**
    - [x] Pipeline: Decode -> D3D11 Surface -> Transfer -> SwScale -> QImage
    - [x] Fallback to Software Decoding on failure
