- [x] **Phase 8: Release v2.0 (Reforged)**
  - [x] **Cleanup**: Remove legacy folders and test apps
  - [x] **Documentation**: Engineering Philosophy & Roadmap
  - [x] **Verification**: Clean Build v2.0.0
  - [x] **CRIT FIX**: Memory Leak & D3D11 Circuit Breaker implementation

- [x] **Phase 9: Performance Enhancements**
  - [x] **RAW Optimization**: Switch to Embedded Preview extraction (100x speedup)
  - [x] **Smart Loading**: Toggle for Fast Preview vs Full Decode implemented via Settings

- [ ] **Phase 10: Debugging Runtime Failure**
  - [x] **Diagnosis**: Analyze crash/failure logs
  - [x] **Fix**: Resolve identified runtime issues

- [x] **Phase 11: Final Polish & Fixes**
  - [x] **Badge Visibility**: Improve contract/size of RAW badge
  - [x] **Re-verify OOM Guard**: Ensure fallback protection is active

- [x] **Phase 13: Concurrency & Fairness**
  - [x] **Non-Blocking RAW**: Implement `tryAcquire` + Re-queue pattern for RAW
  - [x] **Non-Blocking Video**: Implement `tryAcquire` + Re-queue pattern for Video

- [x] **Phase 14: Bug Fixes & Refinement**
  - [x] **Fix DNG Thumbnails**: Resolve broken thumbnails for DNG files (likely OOM guard too aggressive).
  - [x] **Fix Standard Images**: Remove `CoInitialize` from worker threads to prevent WIC conflict (fixing PNG/JPG).

- [x] **Phase 15: Network Path Support**
  - [x] **Diagnosis**: Analyze path handling for UNC/Network compatibility.
  - [x] **Fix**: Ensure correct resolution of `\\Server\Share` paths by replacing manual splicing with `QUrl`.

- [x] **Phase 16: Deployment Fix**
  - [x] **Fix**: Remove `--no-compiler-runtime` from `windeployqt` to allow network/portable usage.

- [ ] **Phase 17: Resource Management**
  - [x] **Refactor**: Make `SystemMonitor::getMemoryUsageMB` static for global access.
  - [x] **Enforce**: In [AsyncImageProvider](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/AsyncImageProvider.h#34-58), check process memory. (REVERTED due to high mutex contention).

- [x] **Phase 18: UI Refactor (Requests)**
  - [x] **Settings Infrastructure**: Add [enableVideo](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/SettingsHelper.cpp#105-108) and [enableRaw](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/SettingsHelper.cpp#116-119) to [SettingsHelper](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/SettingsHelper.h#38-39).
  - [x] **Menu Redesign**: Implement "Plug-ins" section and efficiently layout the Menu tab.
  - [x] **Restart Features**: Add Restart button to Menu and Stats Overlay.
  - [x] **Cleanup**: Move relevant settings from Overlay to Menu.

- [x] **Phase 19: Performance Optimization (Weak Hardware)**
  - [x] **Video Task Throttling**: Limit concurrent video tasks from 4 to 2.
  - [x] **FFmpeg Log Spam**: Throttle HW failure warnings to once per session.
  - [x] **Lower Defaults**: Threads 4→2, Cache 512MB→256MB for weak hardware.
